Estimator: R_bf(f) = (Yboost-Ycut)/(Yflat-Ycut) = (Cboost-Ccut)/(Cflat-Ccut), a function
of ONLY (A0, C11). Bleed, blend, downstream chain, input sweep, JFET all cancel. Measured
at DRIVE-MIN (clipper ~linear), band [25, 1500] Hz, sweep 'sweep_drv_-18'.
