READ-OUT
================================================================================================
  A0:  drive-min 16.1   drive-9:30 24.2   (a LINEAR corner must NOT move with drive — agreement validates the read)
  C11: drive-min 100.00 nF   drive-9:30 100.00 nF

  vs the joint fit (clipA0 15.8, clipC11 7.0 nF) and circuit.md's A0 20-30 prior:
    - If measured A0 ~ 16 and C11 ~ 7 nF: the fit is CORROBORATED; the 20-30 prior is
      wrong for THIS unit (R19-dropped supply lowers the 4049 gain). Accept, then ship.
    - If measured A0 ~ 25 (in prior) and C11 larger: the fit's low A0 was compensating;
      re-fit with clipA0 fenced to [20,30] and C11 free.
    - If A0 disagrees between drives: the drive-min clipper was not linear enough or the
      alignment failed — do NOT trust either number; report and reconsider.
